{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And He blessed them.</b> Because they are diminished and hunted from them and eaten, they required a blessing. And the beasts too required a blessing, except that because of the serpent that was destined to be cursed, therefore He did not bless — so that it not be included." "<b>Be fruitful.</b> From the root פְּרִי — that is, produce fruit." "<b>And multiply.</b> If He had said only פְּרוּ, one would bear one and no more; and וּרְבוּ comes — that one bears many."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:08.182263549Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}